{"slug":"b-r-k","ar":"ب ر ك","total":32,"core":"blessing","forms":[{"ar":"تَبَارَكَ","kind":"verb","form":6,"count":9,"gloss":"to be blessed, exalted","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":78,"p":1,"ar":["تَبَـٰرَكَ","ٱسْمُ","رَبِّكَ","ذِى","ٱلْجَلَـٰلِ","وَٱلْإِكْرَامِ"],"en":"Blessed is the name of your Lord, Owner of Majesty and Honor"}},{"ar":"بَٰرَكَ","kind":"verb","form":3,"count":8,"gloss":"to bless","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":71,"p":6,"ar":["وَنَجَّيْنَـٰهُ","وَلُوطًا","إِلَى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ٱلَّتِى","بَـٰرَكْنَا","فِيهَا","لِلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"And We delivered him and Lot to the land which We had blessed for the worlds"}},{"ar":"مُبَارَك","kind":"passive participle","form":3,"count":8,"gloss":"Blessed","word":"mubarak","ex":{"s":21,"a":50,"p":3,"ar":["وَهَـٰذَا","ذِكْرٌ","مُّبَارَكٌ","أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ ۚ","أَفَأَنتُمْ","لَهُۥ","مُنكِرُونَ"],"en":"And this [Qur'an] is a blessed message which We have sent down. Then are you with it unacquainted"}},{"ar":"مُّبَٰرَكَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"Blessed (feminine)","word":"mubarakah","ex":{"s":44,"a":3,"p":5,"ar":["إِنَّآ","أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","فِى","لَيْلَةٍ","مُّبَـٰرَكَةٍ ۚ","إِنَّا","كُنَّا","مُنذِرِينَ"],"en":"Indeed, We sent it down during a blessed night. Indeed, We were to warn [mankind]"}},{"ar":"بَرَكَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"blessings","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":73,"p":8,"ar":["قَالُوٓا۟","أَتَعْجَبِينَ","مِنْ","أَمْرِ","ٱللَّهِ ۖ","رَحْمَتُ","ٱللَّهِ","وَبَرَكَـٰتُهُۥ","عَلَيْكُمْ","أَهْلَ","ٱلْبَيْتِ ۚ","إِنَّهُۥ","حَمِيدٌ","مَّجِيدٌ"],"en":"They said, \"Are you amazed at the decree of Allah? May the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you, people of the house. Indeed, He is Praiseworthy and Honorable"}}],"surahs":[[7,3],[21,3],[25,3],[6,2],[11,2],[23,2],[24,2],[3,1],[17,1],[19,1],[27,1],[28,1],[34,1],[37,1],[38,1],[40,1],[41,1],[43,1],[44,1],[50,1],[55,1],[67,1]]}